  Text: "\"You got to stop that jerk! <link>Lars Boullie</link>!\" \n\"He's gonna
    give the pictures to the TV people! <link>Miss Marcelle</link> said that would
    be bad. Really bad for everyone!\" \n\"I don't know where he is but he also stole
    <link>Wheezie's new phone, he lives at 24 Nostra Street</link>. Maybe he knows
    something.\" \"His full name is Willbur Brown.\" "
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
